      "x": 2140, "y": 870, "width": 940, "height": 65,
      "text": "Per-story flow: emitWAL(story_started) → spawn subprocess → timeout 45min → exit 0: gitCommit + story_passed\n                                                                              → exit nonzero: retry MAX_RETRIES=3 → story_failed\n                                                                              → exit 124 (timeout): story_skipped",
