    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "conv_greenfield",
      "x": 80, "y": 1825, "width": 850, "height": 460,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#f0fdf4",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 11010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 11011,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "conv_greenfield_t",
      "x": 100, "y": 1835, "width": 810, "height": 440,
      "text": "Greenfield  (New Project)\n────────────────────────────────────\nTop-Down: inject conventions from pack\n\n1. New Project in Rorca → create git repo\n2. Choose convention pack (or blank)\n   → scaffolds project structure + CLAUDE.md + .rorca/\n3. Direction Stack auto-populated from pack\n   (L1 engineering, L2 domain, L3 project)\n4. Write brief → spec gen has full context\n5. Pipeline runs against structured, convention-rich project\n\nKey insight: Scaffolding BEFORE first spec.\nStory 1 implements features, not project setup.\nWithout a pack, Story 1 must choose framework +\nscaffold + implement — fragile, convention drift later.",
      "originalText": "Greenfield  (New Project)\n────────────────────────────────────\nTop-Down: inject conventions from pack\n\n1. New Project in Rorca → create git repo\n2. Choose convention pack (or blank)\n   → scaffolds project structure + CLAUDE.md + .rorca/\n3. Direction Stack auto-populated from pack\n   (L1 engineering, L2 domain, L3 project)\n4. Write brief → spec gen has full context\n5. Pipeline runs against structured, convention-rich project\n\nKey insight: Scaffolding BEFORE first spec.\nStory 1 implements features, not project setup.\nWithout a pack, Story 1 must choose framework +\nscaffold + implement — fragile, convention drift later.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#064e3b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 11012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 11013,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

