    {
      "type": "text", "id": "conv_brownfield_t",
      "x": 1040, "y": 1835, "width": 810, "height": 440,
      "text": "Brownfield  (Existing Codebase)\n────────────────────────────────────\nBottom-Up: extract conventions from codebase\n\n1. Fork / clone existing repo\n2. 'Add Workspace' → point to directory\n3. Auto context extraction:\n   reads codebase → generates L3 + CLAUDE.md + AGENTS.md\n   (convention inference agent)\n4. Human reviews extracted conventions\n   (approve / edit / reject — same flow as spec review)\n5. Write brief → fully context-aware spec gen\n6. Pipeline runs with deep understanding of project\n\nConvention Drift Detection:\n'rorca conventions check' → like terraform plan\nCompares current code against declared conventions.\nReports: \"L2 says 'use Prisma' but legacy.ts uses raw SQL\"",
      "originalText": "Brownfield  (Existing Codebase)\n────────────────────────────────────\nBottom-Up: extract conventions from codebase\n\n1. Fork / clone existing repo\n2. 'Add Workspace' → point to directory\n3. Auto context extraction:\n   reads codebase → generates L3 + CLAUDE.md + AGENTS.md\n   (convention inference agent)\n4. Human reviews extracted conventions\n   (approve / edit / reject — same flow as spec review)\n5. Write brief → fully context-aware spec gen\n6. Pipeline runs with deep understanding of project\n\nConvention Drift Detection:\n'rorca conventions check' → like terraform plan\nCompares current code against declared conventions.\nReports: \"L2 says 'use Prisma' but legacy.ts uses raw SQL\"",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
