      "type": "text", "id": "sec12_sub",
      "x": 2130, "y": 1797, "width": 1960, "height": 18,
      "text": "Pipeline Monitor polls wal_events every 3s · Story progress only appears after execution-engine.ts writes events via fetch to /api/wal",
      "originalText": "Pipeline Monitor polls wal_events every 3s · Story progress only appears after execution-engine.ts writes events via fetch to /api/wal",
