    {
      "type": "text", "id": "wal_events_content",
      "x": 2165, "y": 1840, "width": 1920, "height": 430,
      "text": "run_started           → pipeline execution begins, PID recorded in pipeline_runs\nstory_started         → fresh subprocess spawned, full tool set active (edit, bash, read, write, glob, grep)\nstory_passed          → exit 0: markStoryPassed() + gitCommitStory() + POST /api/pipeline/story-result\nstory_failed          → non-zero exit after MAX_RETRIES=3 exhausted\nstory_skipped         → timeout exit 124 (45 min wall-clock limit via SIGTERM → SIGKILL)\nrun_finished          → all stories processed, status updated in pipeline_runs\n\ncontext_file_changed  → Chokidar watcher detected edit to CLAUDE.md, MEMORY.md, AGENTS.md, config.json\nrun_blocked           → HITL pause — execution-engine.ts waiting for user input via /api/pipeline/resume\nstory_escalated       → OpenCode model escalation (Haiku→Sonnet, Sonnet→Opus on repeated failure)\n\nworktree_created      → autoWorktree=true, new git branch feat/<slug>-<timestamp> created\nworktree_merged       → worktree branch merged back to main after all stories pass\n\ngenerate              → spec generation started\nspec_approved         → spec moved to forge/specs/approved/ via POST /api/specs/:id/approve\nspec_rejected         → spec deleted + content preserved in wal_events payload JSON\n\nSSE endpoint: GET /api/pipeline/stream  ·  Terminal: GET /api/pipeline/runs/:id/output  ·  TS column (NOT created_at)",
      "originalText": "run_started           → pipeline execution begins, PID recorded in pipeline_runs\nstory_started         → fresh subprocess spawned, full tool set active (edit, bash, read, write, glob, grep)\nstory_passed          → exit 0: markStoryPassed() + gitCommitStory() + POST /api/pipeline/story-result\nstory_failed          → non-zero exit after MAX_RETRIES=3 exhausted\nstory_skipped         → timeout exit 124 (45 min wall-clock limit via SIGTERM → SIGKILL)\nrun_finished          → all stories processed, status updated in pipeline_runs\n\ncontext_file_changed  → Chokidar watcher detected edit to CLAUDE.md, MEMORY.md, AGENTS.md, config.json\nrun_blocked           → HITL pause — execution-engine.ts waiting for user input via /api/pipeline/resume\nstory_escalated       → OpenCode model escalation (Haiku→Sonnet, Sonnet→Opus on repeated failure)\n\nworktree_created      → autoWorktree=true, new git branch feat/<slug>-<timestamp> created\nworktree_merged       → worktree branch merged back to main after all stories pass\n\ngenerate              → spec generation started\nspec_approved         → spec moved to forge/specs/approved/ via POST /api/specs/:id/approve\nspec_rejected         → spec deleted + content preserved in wal_events payload JSON\n\nSSE endpoint: GET /api/pipeline/stream  ·  Terminal: GET /api/pipeline/runs/:id/output  ·  TS column (NOT created_at)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
